{"hymn":"S665","parent":"E854","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Son los santos todos","subtitle":"La iglesia—Su coordinación","syl":{"n1":"Son","n2":"los","n3":["san","i"],"n4":["tos","t"],"n5":["to","i"],"n6":["dos","t"],"n7":["Miem","i"],"n8":["bros","t"],"n9":"del","n10":["Se","i"],"n11":["ñor;","t"],"n12":["To","i"],"n13":["dos","t"],"n14":["coor","i"],"n15":["di","m"],"n16":["nan","m"],"n17":["do","t"],"n18":["Lle","i"],"n19":["gan","t"],"n20":"a","n21":["la‿u","i"],"n22":["nión.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Muchos son los dones,","Un Espíritu;","Muchas las funciones,","Un Señor, Jesús."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Estimando a otros,","Sin parcialidad;","Cada uno tiene","Su utilidad."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Conforme a la gracia","Es también el don;","Con cordura todos","Cumplen su función."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Hace cada uno","Siempre su deber;","Con fervor ceñido","Su espíritu fiel."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Supliendo y cuidando","Con gracia y amor;","No en discordancia","Dando a Cristo honor."]},{"label":"7.","lines":["Es la iglesia el Cuerpo,","La Cabeza, Tú;","Al fluir nos une","El Espíritu."]}]}